{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜孫中山誕辰160周年紀念儀式／立法會續會討論北都條例草案\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261112.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】孫中山先生誕辰160周年紀念儀式今日(11月12日)在中山紀念公園舉行，行政長官李家超主禮並致辭。同日立法會會議續會，繼續討論北部都會區發展條例草案。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:26:17.252497+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T23:20:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T15:57:15.194965+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T00:19:51.143591+00:00","content_hash":"5b97feefa09c4e1c7a7f624c6fb05d7acaece27a3eb51d8bab7a35306a346e76","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:26:17.252497+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}